T Ball on a string
# Strings are inextensible in tension and limp otherwise, and they can run over guides, which is
# how you build a pulley. Balls are spheres with mass that roll and collide.
! a gantry
C P1 W8 -2,0,0.5 x y
C T1 W8 -2,0,2.5 x y
R P1 T1
C P2 W8 2,0,0.5 x y
C T2 W8 2,0,2.5 x y
R P2 T2
R T1 T2
O ball 0,0,1.5 d=25 mass=40
Y cord T1 ball
A P1
A P2
